WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:31.400
‪ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
‪ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:48.040 --> 01:49.280
The fetus already has bones.

01:49.880 --> 01:50.840
At least four months along.

01:50.920 --> 01:52.960
But Lady Wang's medical record
has no note about this.

01:53.560 --> 01:55.600
The powder on the wings
was smeared on by someone.

01:56.120 --> 01:58.960
Flint powder.
This kind of butterfly feeds on rot,

01:59.040 --> 02:00.480
usually near damp marshes.

02:00.560 --> 02:02.120
But the Sepulchral Hall sits high up,

02:02.200 --> 02:03.360
dry and well-ventilated.

02:03.440 --> 02:04.760
Someone released the butterfly inside.

02:07.200 --> 02:08.880
They really planned this well.

02:10.320 --> 02:12.040
What happened here?

02:13.080 --> 02:13.920
Oh no.

02:14.000 --> 02:15.720
I… I have to report this.

02:16.760 --> 02:17.960
If you report it now,

02:18.040 --> 02:20.160
this year's Lantern Festival,
you'll be using the gold ingots

02:20.240 --> 02:21.720
your family burns for you.

02:22.320 --> 02:23.280
Your Ladyship,

02:23.360 --> 02:25.800
what… what are you trying to do?

02:27.360 --> 02:30.240
One foot's already in the underworld,
and you're still asking what I'll do?

02:30.840 --> 02:31.640
What a hassle.

02:32.240 --> 02:34.760
By protocol,
a consort's coffin is catalpa.

02:34.840 --> 02:37.360
But Lady Wang's coffin was river willow.

02:37.440 --> 02:39.880
And it was stuffed full of pine shavings.

02:39.960 --> 02:41.720
It seems meant for damp and odors,

02:41.800 --> 02:44.720
but in fact, like river willow,
it's highly flammable.

02:44.800 --> 02:46.760
Plus, there is
that easily ignited flint powder.

02:46.840 --> 02:49.520
Lady Wang's body being destroyed
was thanks to all of this.

02:51.200 --> 02:53.840
This servant only guards and buries.

02:54.520 --> 02:57.280
I don't know what you mean…

02:57.360 --> 02:59.680
Then I'll put it in words you understand.

03:00.200 --> 03:01.280
You were lax in oversight.

03:01.360 --> 03:04.040
The coffin in the morgue was swapped,
and you noticed nothing.

03:04.120 --> 03:05.000
You failed at guarding it,

03:05.080 --> 03:07.240
and Lady Wang's body was burned.

03:07.320 --> 03:08.760
If you rush to report it,

03:08.840 --> 03:10.360
you're walking straight into a trap.

03:10.440 --> 03:12.920
You really think
you can dodge all responsibility?

03:13.560 --> 03:15.280
Please enlighten me, Your Ladyship.

03:15.880 --> 03:18.160
I know you've done your duty.

03:18.240 --> 03:20.960
So I'm giving you a chance to make amends.

03:22.600 --> 03:25.000
How do I make amends?

03:27.720 --> 03:29.160
Is everyone here?

03:29.920 --> 03:32.120
All on night duty today are here.

03:33.840 --> 03:35.280
Everyone, hold out your hands.

03:35.360 --> 03:37.160
Do exactly as he says!

03:47.160 --> 03:48.240
Your Ladyship,

03:48.320 --> 03:50.400
what… are you checking for?

03:55.840 --> 03:57.400
There was flint powder on their wings.

03:57.480 --> 03:59.640
In theory, if it was done by these people,

03:59.720 --> 04:02.120
someone's hands would be covered in it.

04:02.880 --> 04:05.040
And in the dark room,
there'd be a big patch of green glow.

04:06.600 --> 04:08.520
Unless someone
was working with an outsider

04:08.600 --> 04:09.920
and didn't do it themselves,

04:10.520 --> 04:11.360
just…

04:11.960 --> 04:12.640
Who is it?

04:16.120 --> 04:17.360
Wang Dejun?

04:23.680 --> 04:25.160
You're not on duty tonight.

04:25.240 --> 04:26.160
What are you doing here?

04:26.240 --> 04:27.880
Liang Weishan told me to come.

04:28.520 --> 04:30.440
He took leave today,
so I'm covering for him.

04:31.040 --> 04:33.360
Liang Weishan really didn't come.

04:33.440 --> 04:34.680
When did you arrive?

04:35.400 --> 04:36.640
About one ke ago.

04:37.280 --> 04:38.400
You remember that clearly.

04:38.480 --> 04:39.520
Seize him.

04:39.600 --> 04:40.480
Yes, madam!

05:02.800 --> 05:05.560
This trick is both merciful and vicious.

05:05.640 --> 05:07.840
Only you can came up with this way.

05:09.120 --> 05:10.360
It's all thanks to Mr. Xiao.

05:10.920 --> 05:13.440
He won't let me use torture,
but he still wants a confession.

05:14.560 --> 05:15.600
Let go of me!

05:16.160 --> 05:17.280
Come on.

05:17.360 --> 05:19.600
Let's go question
this "butterfly gentleman."

05:32.600 --> 05:33.560
Who told you to do it?

05:33.640 --> 05:35.160
Do what?

05:35.240 --> 05:36.280
What did I do?

05:36.880 --> 05:39.320
The butterflies flew in through
the vent window of the Sepulchral Hall.

05:39.400 --> 05:41.400
They were drawn by the rot

05:41.480 --> 05:42.840
and circled over the body.

05:42.920 --> 05:45.320
The flint powder smeared on their wings

05:45.400 --> 05:46.560
fell onto the corpse.

05:46.640 --> 05:47.480
It was muggy tonight.

05:47.560 --> 05:49.200
The coffin was full of foul gas.

05:49.280 --> 05:50.880
Flint powder ignites with heat,

05:51.480 --> 05:53.080
and the wood shavings and coffin

05:53.160 --> 05:54.040
are both highly flammable.

05:54.120 --> 05:55.400
The fire flared up in an instant,

05:55.480 --> 05:57.240
and the body was burned to ash.

05:57.320 --> 06:00.280
Those butterflies were released
through the vent by you.

06:01.360 --> 06:02.880
I don't know what you're talking about.

06:02.960 --> 06:04.040
I didn't do anything.

06:04.640 --> 06:05.760
You're framing me,

06:05.840 --> 06:06.880
setting me up,

06:06.960 --> 06:09.240
and using these disgusting bugs
to force a confession.

06:09.320 --> 06:10.480
I'm not admitting anything!

06:10.560 --> 06:12.000
Bluffing.

06:12.520 --> 06:13.760
You've got no experience
being questioned, huh?

06:15.200 --> 06:16.680
Butterflies aren't easy to find.

06:17.320 --> 06:19.600
We finally lured some moths in for you,

06:19.680 --> 06:20.520
and you call them disgusting?

06:21.400 --> 06:23.600
If we could question you,
we won't wrong you.

06:23.680 --> 06:25.760
Flint powder is common in a graveyard.

06:25.840 --> 06:28.520
You were terrified
of leaving any trace of it.

06:28.600 --> 06:31.320
So that bath-bean scent on your hands
can be smelled from five paces away.

06:32.120 --> 06:34.320
I just like being clean.
I happened to wash my hands.

06:34.400 --> 06:36.520
You can't just use that to pin this on me!

06:37.360 --> 06:38.200
Fine.

06:38.280 --> 06:39.960
Then answer me one more thing.

06:40.040 --> 06:41.640
Why did you cover a shift today?

06:42.720 --> 06:44.880
Actually, I meant to get medicine today.

06:45.400 --> 06:47.480
I hadn't agreed to switch
with Liang Weishan yesterday.

06:48.080 --> 06:50.080
But the physician left town early,
so I figured

06:50.160 --> 06:52.920
I'd cover his shift and earn a bit more.

06:53.000 --> 06:55.400
Then why didn't you report when summoned?

06:55.480 --> 06:56.680
After I got here,

06:56.760 --> 06:59.160
I was busy cleaning the front rows
of tombstones.

06:59.240 --> 07:00.480
It took a full ke.

07:00.560 --> 07:01.840
I never heard any summons.

07:04.520 --> 07:06.000
You've rehearsed your lines well,

07:06.080 --> 07:07.720
but when you say them, they're stiff.

07:07.800 --> 07:10.240
Let me teach you
a questioning trick I just learned.

07:10.320 --> 07:11.640
When Her Ladyship asks you,

07:11.720 --> 07:13.440
"Why did you cover a shift today?",

07:13.520 --> 07:14.440
a normal person says,

07:15.040 --> 07:17.680
"I happened to be free,
so I covered for extra pay."

07:17.760 --> 07:19.240
Then if she asks,

07:19.320 --> 07:21.200
"Why didn't you report when summoned?",

07:21.280 --> 07:22.320
a normal person says,

07:22.400 --> 07:24.400
"I was working. I didn't hear."

07:24.480 --> 07:26.240
Someone with nothing to hide

07:26.320 --> 07:27.680
answers exactly what's asked.

07:27.760 --> 07:30.160
Only when pressed further
do they explain the details.

07:30.240 --> 07:31.760
She asked you one question,

07:31.840 --> 07:33.840
and you spilled the whole story,
start to finish.

07:33.920 --> 07:35.240
You expect us to believe you're innocent?

07:36.680 --> 07:38.200
I…

07:39.160 --> 07:41.200
Learn from Mr. Xiao.

07:41.800 --> 07:43.600
Next time you're caught
doing something shady,

07:43.680 --> 07:44.560
don't be so obvious about it.

07:46.120 --> 07:46.960
Words aren't proof!

07:51.360 --> 07:52.440
Chase them down!

07:55.920 --> 07:57.800
Who? Who is it?

07:57.880 --> 07:59.080
Who's trying to kill me?

07:59.760 --> 08:01.240
Ask yourself.

08:01.320 --> 08:02.280
Who wants you dead?

08:07.680 --> 08:09.680
It was… a woman.

08:10.200 --> 08:11.400
Dressed in black.

08:11.480 --> 08:13.400
She gave me a box of butterflies.

08:13.480 --> 08:17.040
She said if someone
came to view Lady Wang's body,

08:17.120 --> 08:18.440
I should release the butterflies.

08:19.800 --> 08:21.400
They were so hard to keep alive.

08:21.480 --> 08:22.760
More than half of them died.

08:22.840 --> 08:24.120
If you'd come a few days later,

08:24.200 --> 08:25.920
I'd have had none left to release.

08:26.520 --> 08:28.000
Anything else about her?

08:28.680 --> 08:29.800
She was extremely cautious,

08:30.320 --> 08:31.240
face under the hood,

08:31.320 --> 08:33.240
even hands inside the robe.

08:33.919 --> 08:35.440
I… I couldn't see her features.

08:36.880 --> 08:38.320
You didn't see anything,

08:38.400 --> 08:39.760
and you still took the job?

08:39.840 --> 08:42.400
How could I know
she wanted to burn the body?

08:42.480 --> 08:44.000
I thought it was
just releasing butterflies

08:44.080 --> 08:45.720
for a string of coins.

08:46.760 --> 08:48.600
Your Ladyship, we didn't catch them.

08:48.680 --> 08:50.240
You didn't?

08:50.320 --> 08:53.120
An assassin in the palace,
and you couldn't catch them?

08:53.720 --> 08:56.360
We've asked what we needed. Let him go.

08:58.280 --> 08:59.200
No, don't let me go!

08:59.920 --> 09:02.400
If I step out now, I'm dead for sure!

09:03.080 --> 09:04.040
Lock me up!

09:04.560 --> 09:05.840
I still have more to tell!

09:07.000 --> 09:09.680
What you've said
isn't enough to convict you.

09:09.760 --> 09:10.760
I can only let you go.

09:11.840 --> 09:13.600
I… I have physical evidence!

09:14.680 --> 09:16.840
That box for raising butterflies
looked valuable.

09:16.920 --> 09:18.920
She told me to burn it after it was done.

09:19.520 --> 09:20.760
I couldn't bring myself to.

09:21.880 --> 09:23.880
So I hid it under the corridor
outside the Sepulchral Hall.

09:25.120 --> 09:26.680
- Go find it.
- Yes, madam.

09:29.520 --> 09:31.240
Now can you lock me up?

09:34.400 --> 09:36.160
You helped by providing evidence.

09:36.240 --> 09:37.120
All the more reason to let you go.

09:39.200 --> 09:40.120
No!

09:41.480 --> 09:42.760
Help!

09:47.040 --> 09:49.920
Boss, that arrow I shot
matched Prosecutor Gu's, right?

09:50.000 --> 09:51.560
Not bad. You're improving.

09:52.320 --> 09:54.200
Did that kick you gave him
blow off some steam?

09:55.720 --> 09:56.920
Good enough.

09:59.960 --> 10:02.200
So Lady Wang really was pregnant?

10:02.880 --> 10:05.160
Why sneak about?
We're just talking about the case.

10:06.760 --> 10:09.080
I'm used to talking palace secrets.

10:09.160 --> 10:10.920
HANLIANG HALL

10:11.000 --> 10:13.800
After His Majesty granted her the title,
he never shared Lady Wang's bed again.

10:14.320 --> 10:15.200
So it seems

10:15.800 --> 10:18.240
Lady Wang had an affair

10:18.320 --> 10:19.560
and got pregnant.

10:19.640 --> 10:22.280
The child's father feared it'd be exposed,
so he killed her.

10:23.240 --> 10:24.880
A consort having an affair
is a grave crime.

10:24.960 --> 10:27.440
We can't lightly pin that charge on her.

10:30.800 --> 10:32.920
When was the last time
the Medical Officer took her pulse?

10:33.640 --> 10:34.760
Over a month ago.

10:35.680 --> 10:37.520
A pregnancy pulse is easiest to tell.

10:37.600 --> 10:40.160
So, she couldn't have hidden it.

10:42.480 --> 10:44.000
That Medical Officer must know something.

10:54.080 --> 10:55.720
Your Ladyship, Mr. Xiao.

10:55.800 --> 10:56.960
Have something to eat.

10:57.560 --> 10:58.880
Hanliang Hall is so remote.

10:58.960 --> 11:01.440
If your lady wants to visit other palaces,

11:01.520 --> 11:02.600
it'd be a hassle.

11:02.680 --> 11:03.880
It is remote,

11:04.600 --> 11:05.760
but my lady only goes

11:05.840 --> 11:09.080
to the Music Office sometimes
to tune and restring her ruan.

11:09.160 --> 11:10.440
She rarely goes out.

11:11.480 --> 11:13.360
My lady is proud and aloof.

11:13.440 --> 11:14.840
She doesn't like socializing.

11:16.400 --> 11:17.360
Then,

11:17.880 --> 11:19.320
she could easily offend people.

11:19.400 --> 11:21.080
She keeps to herself.

11:21.160 --> 11:23.120
She'd have no chance to offend anyone.

11:24.040 --> 11:25.200
In the palace,

11:25.280 --> 11:27.520
she either chants sutras or plays the qin.

11:28.120 --> 11:29.400
Those consorts and ladies

11:29.480 --> 11:32.320
probably don't even know
there was a selected lady like her.

11:32.920 --> 11:35.680
Before she died of a chill,
did anything seem unusual?

11:36.360 --> 11:39.080
Two months before she died,

11:39.160 --> 11:41.080
Consort Wei came to see her.

11:41.160 --> 11:43.240
Consort Wei knows music well.

11:43.320 --> 11:46.400
She admired my lady's talent,
considering her a kindred spirit.

11:47.000 --> 11:48.800
She even gifted her a ruan.

11:49.320 --> 11:51.600
Does that count?

11:52.840 --> 11:54.840
What your lady ate and drank

11:54.920 --> 11:56.040
all passed through your hands?

11:56.120 --> 11:57.800
Yes.

11:57.880 --> 12:01.440
If someone wanted
to poison her a little at a time,

12:01.520 --> 12:03.200
wouldn't you be the easiest route?

12:03.280 --> 12:06.040
Your Ladyship, what do you mean?

12:06.640 --> 12:08.560
We haven't served my lady for long,

12:08.640 --> 12:10.520
but she's been very kind to us.

12:10.600 --> 12:13.240
How could we ever dare poison my lady?

12:14.040 --> 12:15.120
Besides you,

12:15.200 --> 12:16.520
who else had the chance?

12:18.080 --> 12:20.400
There is one thing
that doesn't go through our hands.

12:20.480 --> 12:21.720
Her medicine.

12:21.800 --> 12:24.120
The Medical Officer
prescribed it to soothe her nerves.

12:34.280 --> 12:36.520
It was clearly in there. Where did it go?

12:37.400 --> 12:38.800
Looks like they acted fast.

12:51.720 --> 12:52.760
This begonia

12:52.840 --> 12:55.480
- was moved from beside the table?
- Yes.

12:55.560 --> 12:56.880
Why move it?

12:56.960 --> 12:59.560
This begonia used to grow well.

13:00.160 --> 13:02.400
Starting last month,
it suddenly began to wither.

13:02.480 --> 13:05.800
I thought putting it by the window
to get more air might help,

13:06.440 --> 13:08.680
so I swapped the two pots.

13:08.760 --> 13:10.440
However,

13:10.520 --> 13:13.160
it didn't get better,

13:13.240 --> 13:15.040
and the other pot is wilting too.

13:21.640 --> 13:23.760
Your Ladyship, can you tell what this is?

13:30.560 --> 13:31.560
White peony root.

13:31.640 --> 13:32.720
Mulberry mistletoe.

13:32.800 --> 13:33.640
Honey-fried licorice.

13:35.120 --> 13:36.360
This isn't a calming decoction.

13:36.440 --> 13:37.320
It's a pregnancy tonic.

13:38.600 --> 13:39.680
A pregnancy tonic?

13:40.480 --> 13:41.920
But my lady wasn't pregnant.

13:42.000 --> 13:43.680
Why would this be here?

13:44.280 --> 13:46.400
Could this kind of medicine
make plants wither?

13:47.640 --> 13:48.560
No.

13:49.080 --> 13:50.760
The medicine was poisoned.

13:54.920 --> 13:57.440
Did Lady Wang usually like to drink wine?

13:58.040 --> 14:00.920
When she first arrived,
my lady was in low spirits.

14:01.000 --> 14:03.040
She did drink to drown her sorrows.

14:03.120 --> 14:05.960
But later, I didn't see her drink anymore.

14:10.000 --> 14:11.200
Could it be…

14:19.960 --> 14:21.680
This killer is truly ruthless.

14:21.760 --> 14:23.280
The Medical Officer's
ship sank on his way home.

14:23.360 --> 14:24.800
They never even found his body.

14:26.320 --> 14:28.200
From when Yushu fell ill to when she died,

14:28.280 --> 14:29.560
he was in charge, right?

14:29.640 --> 14:30.960
Yes.

14:31.040 --> 14:32.880
What are these? Where did you find from?

14:34.320 --> 14:37.280
Our sharp-eyed Mr. Xiao
found them in flowerpots,

14:37.360 --> 14:39.440
the pregnancy tonic used to poison Yushu.

14:40.360 --> 14:41.320
How did you find it?

14:43.640 --> 14:45.960
Begonias are easy to keep alive,
and it's the blooming season.

14:46.040 --> 14:47.480
Yet this pot was nearly dead.

14:47.560 --> 14:48.400
That's highly abnormal.

14:48.480 --> 14:51.040
And on a plant, the sunny side
usually grows thicker and fuller.

14:51.120 --> 14:52.960
But on this begonia, the sunward side

14:53.040 --> 14:54.840
was sparse instead, even more abnormal.

14:54.920 --> 14:56.000
Sure enough,

14:56.080 --> 14:57.800
Ruisheng said this begonia had been moved.

14:58.760 --> 14:59.600
And then?

14:59.680 --> 15:01.280
I checked the other plants in the room.

15:01.360 --> 15:02.600
Aside from the begonia,

15:02.680 --> 15:04.640
only the one by the table
was a bit wilted.

15:04.720 --> 15:05.920
And Ruisheng said

15:06.000 --> 15:07.640
the begonia was moved
from beside the table.

15:07.720 --> 15:10.040
Two pots kept by the table withered
one after another.

15:10.120 --> 15:11.400
That can't be a coincidence.

15:12.000 --> 15:14.560
And the table
is the most used spot in the room,

15:14.640 --> 15:15.640
so I had a suspicion.

15:20.400 --> 15:21.640
Mr. Xiao,

15:21.720 --> 15:23.480
just tell Wuren the truth already.

15:24.000 --> 15:25.000
How did you figure it out?

15:29.960 --> 15:31.080
I…

15:31.160 --> 15:32.480
cast a divination.

15:35.040 --> 15:36.800
You're unbelievable.

15:37.400 --> 15:38.840
So what now?

15:38.920 --> 15:40.680
This medicine's been boiled
and dried out for so long.

15:40.760 --> 15:42.120
Can the poison still be identified?

15:42.960 --> 15:45.360
It's tricky, but not impossible.

15:54.800 --> 15:57.960
Hard to detect, slow-acting poison.

15:58.040 --> 15:59.680
Unbearable pain marks the end.

16:00.200 --> 16:02.400
The corpse shows
red, flower-shaped blotches.

16:09.200 --> 16:11.400
TREATISE ON FEBRILE DISEASES, VOL. 2

16:31.160 --> 16:32.360
Can't tell by smell.

16:58.520 --> 17:00.960
From now on,
don't investigate by hurting yourself.

17:01.040 --> 17:02.520
As your partner,

17:02.600 --> 17:05.319
I'll think of other ways
to solve the problem.

17:05.920 --> 17:08.680
You getting hurt is my failure.

17:17.839 --> 17:19.119
You little rascal…

17:21.400 --> 17:23.680
My good master, can you tell what it is?

17:27.520 --> 17:28.800
It's Yunxiang Powder.

17:31.240 --> 17:32.240
Yunxiang…

17:39.200 --> 17:40.840
You crazy girl.

17:41.360 --> 17:44.400
I actually believed
you'd grown a conscience,

17:45.040 --> 17:49.680
bringing all this fine food and wine
to honor your old master.

17:50.680 --> 17:53.840
Turns out you're trying to poison me,
so you can feast at my funeral.

17:54.960 --> 17:57.800
Old man, why paint me that evil?

17:57.880 --> 17:59.600
I came to ask you for help.

18:00.280 --> 18:01.920
Couldn't you just ask?

18:02.000 --> 18:03.960
Why poison the soup?

18:05.400 --> 18:07.520
I didn't want it to sway your judgment.

18:07.600 --> 18:10.040
Xiao's already gone to check.

18:10.120 --> 18:12.760
Why should I suffer for this?

18:12.840 --> 18:14.680
We had to confirm it.

18:14.760 --> 18:18.240
Besides, who knew you'd react this hard?

18:18.320 --> 18:20.520
Lady Wang took it for a month
before it kicked in.

18:21.960 --> 18:22.800
Exactly.

18:22.880 --> 18:24.720
So why am I reacting this hard?

18:27.680 --> 18:29.120
I brewed it a bit stronger.

18:32.040 --> 18:34.320
One day you'll kill me
with your own hands!

18:38.480 --> 18:39.320
Mr. Du.

18:39.400 --> 18:40.720
The medical text says

18:40.800 --> 18:43.520
after taking Yunxiang Powder,
you mustn't drink.

18:43.600 --> 18:46.640
So, you'd better drink cold water.

18:47.280 --> 18:48.760
So you really found it.

18:48.840 --> 18:49.840
What does the book say?

18:50.600 --> 18:52.560
I found three poisons that can leave

18:52.640 --> 18:54.800
red, flower-shaped marks on the skin.

18:54.880 --> 18:56.400
One comes from the Western Regions.

18:56.480 --> 18:57.440
It's extremely potent.

18:57.520 --> 18:59.560
Just a tiny dose
and you cough blood and die on the spot.

18:59.640 --> 19:01.400
Another one comes from Changbai Mountain,

19:02.000 --> 19:02.960
but it reeks.

19:03.040 --> 19:06.280
Lady Wang would have noticed it
straight away.

19:06.360 --> 19:07.280
It's likely not the one.

19:07.880 --> 19:09.480
That leaves Yunxiang Powder.

19:11.320 --> 19:14.000
Yunxiang Powder is produced in Annan.

19:14.080 --> 19:16.800
It was originally used as medicine,

19:17.400 --> 19:18.840
but taken long-term,

19:19.360 --> 19:20.280
it becomes poison.

19:20.360 --> 19:22.160
No symptoms day to day,

19:22.240 --> 19:23.880
only at the very end

19:23.960 --> 19:25.160
it causes unbearable pain.

19:25.800 --> 19:28.080
By the time it flares up,

19:28.160 --> 19:29.920
the poisoner is already long gone.

19:30.680 --> 19:32.560
This drug

19:33.760 --> 19:34.920
is rare now.

19:35.880 --> 19:37.800
But you must know where to find it.

19:39.040 --> 19:39.920
I don't.

19:41.720 --> 19:43.160
Old man,

19:43.240 --> 19:44.560
are you really going to let this case

19:44.640 --> 19:46.680
go unsolved just because you're mad at me?

19:52.480 --> 19:54.160
Bring brush and ink.

19:54.240 --> 19:57.400
GHOST MARKET

20:28.000 --> 20:29.040
Here.

20:32.120 --> 20:34.080
Don't mention my name
before the shop owner.

20:54.520 --> 20:55.760
Sir,

20:55.840 --> 20:57.400
Du Zhixing sent me to find you.

21:04.560 --> 21:05.440
What,

21:07.280 --> 21:09.680
Du Zhixing isn't dead yet?

21:10.360 --> 21:12.720
What, you want him killed?

21:13.240 --> 21:14.440
How much are you paying?

21:15.320 --> 21:18.440
HEIYA, APOTHECARY OWNER

21:18.520 --> 21:20.280
Come with me.

21:52.520 --> 21:55.760
What kind of business are you two in?

21:56.400 --> 21:57.680
I came to see you,

21:57.760 --> 21:59.480
so, of course,
it's a business of human lives.

22:00.080 --> 22:02.920
With your skills,

22:03.000 --> 22:06.160
you still need me to kill someone?

22:06.880 --> 22:09.400
Killing with blades is always crude.

22:12.120 --> 22:15.720
- You want something elegant?
- Yes.

22:15.800 --> 22:18.080
Elegant, tragic,

22:18.160 --> 22:19.920
and killing without a trace.

22:20.560 --> 22:21.640
Poison.

22:22.200 --> 22:23.960
But ordinary poison won't do.

22:24.040 --> 22:26.520
If you get the bleeding, the blue face…

22:26.600 --> 22:27.440
What a sight!

22:29.520 --> 22:31.240
I've got something here

22:32.080 --> 22:33.960
you'll definitely like.

22:34.600 --> 22:35.640
Let's hear it.

22:36.320 --> 22:38.240
Yunxiang Powder.

22:38.960 --> 22:39.880
What's so special about it?

22:40.480 --> 22:42.360
Colorless, tasteless.

22:42.440 --> 22:44.000
Delayed onset.

22:44.080 --> 22:47.400
Agony at death,

22:48.120 --> 22:50.960
but afterward,
it looks like they're just asleep.

22:52.960 --> 22:55.720
Any poison that can be traced
isn't a good poison.

22:56.400 --> 22:58.160
It takes seven days after death

22:58.240 --> 23:00.320
for signs of poisoning to appear.

23:00.840 --> 23:02.520
Hard to detect.

23:02.600 --> 23:06.240
And the body will surface

23:06.320 --> 23:08.080
flower-shaped marks.

23:09.000 --> 23:09.960
Beautiful, really.

23:10.560 --> 23:12.480
You'll love it, my lady.

23:13.560 --> 23:14.960
Such a fine poison.

23:15.040 --> 23:16.240
How have I never heard of it?

23:17.840 --> 23:21.560
Anything everyone knows,
I don't sell here.

23:22.560 --> 23:25.000
If it became famous,

23:25.720 --> 23:28.480
how could it kill without a trace?

23:29.600 --> 23:30.680
You're right.

23:36.080 --> 23:39.320
And you, sir, what do you think?

23:41.960 --> 23:43.120
Talk is cheap.

23:46.520 --> 23:49.080
This way, please.

25:41.560 --> 25:42.400
Shorty!

25:42.480 --> 25:44.280
Attempted murder
before the deal is even struck?

25:44.360 --> 25:46.080
If you don't die,

25:46.880 --> 25:48.480
I'm the one who dies.

26:34.120 --> 26:37.760
You're still alive?

26:52.680 --> 26:53.840
Come with me!

26:55.200 --> 26:56.480
Give me your hand.

27:10.600 --> 27:11.880
A bloody handprint on you!

27:13.960 --> 27:15.080
There's something mixed into this blood.

27:15.160 --> 27:16.160
No wonder the alligator only attacked you.

27:16.240 --> 27:17.880
He must've left it when he pushed me in.

27:18.480 --> 27:19.440
That shorty is vicious.

27:36.960 --> 27:38.800
Like it? I'll add a little extra.

27:47.160 --> 27:48.640
Freshly mixed Softening Powder.

27:48.720 --> 27:49.600
Lucky you.

27:53.000 --> 27:54.280
Who told you to do this?

27:54.360 --> 27:56.520
You kept not showing up,

27:57.040 --> 27:59.040
so I kept worrying.

27:59.560 --> 28:01.240
Now that you're here,

28:01.920 --> 28:03.640
I finally feel at ease.

28:04.240 --> 28:05.840
So you still want to live.

28:06.560 --> 28:08.440
Tell me who sent you to kill me,

28:08.520 --> 28:09.440
and I'll spare your life.

28:12.120 --> 28:13.680
If you won't talk,

28:13.760 --> 28:15.000
come back with us
to the Palace Investigation Bureau.

28:16.960 --> 28:18.560
Step into the Ghost Market,

28:19.080 --> 28:21.320
and you belong to it for life.

28:21.400 --> 28:22.760
You're not taking me!

28:23.360 --> 28:24.320
Careful!

28:27.600 --> 28:28.480
I said it…

28:28.560 --> 28:31.640
You're not taking me…

28:35.960 --> 28:37.160
Wait for me outside.

28:37.240 --> 28:38.280
- I need to find something.
- No.

28:38.360 --> 28:39.960
Half a ke at most.

28:40.040 --> 28:41.240
Find it or not, I'll come out.

28:45.920 --> 28:46.960
Take care.

28:57.520 --> 28:58.760
You started the fire?

28:59.360 --> 29:00.680
It was probably that shorty.

29:00.760 --> 29:01.600
Before he went in,

29:01.680 --> 29:03.480
he lit a fuse hidden somewhere outside.

29:04.080 --> 29:05.280
If he killed us and got away,

29:05.360 --> 29:06.960
he could put it out in time.

29:07.040 --> 29:08.520
If he couldn't get out alive,

29:08.600 --> 29:09.440
then it's mutual destruction.

29:11.560 --> 29:13.160
Let's get out of here first.

29:17.040 --> 29:18.760
DU'S MANSION

29:21.720 --> 29:23.240
You made it back alive?

29:23.840 --> 29:25.640
Old man, you set me up!

29:27.960 --> 29:29.560
Right back at you.

29:30.240 --> 29:33.520
Dealing with Heiya took you this long?

29:34.120 --> 29:35.600
He had an alligator.

29:35.680 --> 29:37.440
I made it back alive,
and you can't even praise me?

29:39.040 --> 29:41.880
You burned down his den.

29:43.160 --> 29:44.080
What's there to praise?

29:45.240 --> 29:46.200
It wasn't me.

29:46.280 --> 29:47.120
He did it to himself.

29:51.480 --> 29:52.360
He's dead?

29:53.800 --> 29:55.520
What, you'll miss him?

29:58.320 --> 30:00.480
He did have plenty of good stuff.

30:01.080 --> 30:02.400
Shame it couldn't see daylight.

30:03.600 --> 30:05.560
The goods all burned up?

30:06.920 --> 30:07.920
Not all of it.

30:19.400 --> 30:20.560
Oh, Yunxiang Powder.

30:21.760 --> 30:22.880
What about the buyer?

30:23.480 --> 30:25.560
You didn't find the ledger?

30:26.200 --> 30:27.560
The ledger was burned.

30:29.560 --> 30:31.160
But not completely.

30:32.080 --> 30:33.360
Evidence, after all.

30:33.440 --> 30:35.400
You've got to save what you can.

30:36.200 --> 30:37.480
But the writing on this…

30:39.040 --> 30:40.440
When you work a case,

30:40.960 --> 30:43.080
you can't rely on ordinary methods…

30:43.880 --> 30:45.160
alone.

30:45.760 --> 30:46.760
Of course.

30:47.280 --> 30:49.360
But if people found out,
it wouldn't look good.

30:51.280 --> 30:52.240
Spit it out.

30:52.880 --> 30:54.160
How do I get it?

30:58.920 --> 31:00.360
Didn't I already give it to you?

31:00.440 --> 31:02.760
I mean the key to the hidden compartment.

31:04.000 --> 31:05.760
When I retired,

31:05.840 --> 31:07.000
I turned it in.

31:10.000 --> 31:11.400
Fine, so be it.

31:11.920 --> 31:13.040
Where are you going?

31:13.800 --> 31:15.640
Back to the Bureau to file the evidence.

31:17.000 --> 31:20.920
At least let me see what it says.

31:21.000 --> 31:23.240
You're retired. You don't get to.

31:28.440 --> 31:29.520
Here!

31:36.280 --> 31:37.640
You little rascal.

31:38.160 --> 31:39.640
You're messing with me again?

31:40.760 --> 31:42.320
How is that messing with you?

31:47.240 --> 31:48.120
Not bad.

31:49.080 --> 31:50.960
A load off my mind.

32:05.600 --> 32:06.880
Old man…

32:06.960 --> 32:08.480
ELEGANCE AND BLESSINGS

32:08.560 --> 32:09.520
Mr. Xiao,

32:10.040 --> 32:12.440
why is this sachet in your hand?

32:13.360 --> 32:15.080
Lady Wang dropped it at the Music Office.

32:15.160 --> 32:16.120
Someone picked it up.

32:16.200 --> 32:17.680
When it went missing,

32:17.760 --> 32:19.040
my lady was so upset.

32:19.720 --> 32:22.640
We turned the whole place upside down
and still couldn't find it.

32:22.720 --> 32:24.680
Over this sachet,

32:24.760 --> 32:27.240
my lady scolded us harshly
for the first time.

32:27.840 --> 32:30.320
Do you know what it once held?

32:30.400 --> 32:31.920
My lady never said.

32:39.880 --> 32:40.760
Did Lady Wang

32:41.560 --> 32:43.120
ever meet someone alone,

32:43.760 --> 32:45.520
especially at night?

32:49.760 --> 32:51.360
Even if my lady wasn't favored,

32:51.440 --> 32:53.280
she couldn't be left unattended.

32:53.880 --> 32:56.440
My lady had no time alone.

32:59.280 --> 33:00.120
Except…

33:01.440 --> 33:03.400
when she chanted sutras.

33:13.240 --> 33:15.400
This altar was set up by your lady?

33:16.040 --> 33:17.160
Yes.

33:17.240 --> 33:18.880
When my lady was alive,

33:18.960 --> 33:20.880
she tended it herself.

33:20.960 --> 33:21.960
Now,

33:22.040 --> 33:23.800
I think it's best

33:23.880 --> 33:25.360
not to let the incense go out.

33:25.440 --> 33:28.120
My lady chanted here every night.

33:28.200 --> 33:30.040
At that time, she didn't need attendants.

33:30.120 --> 33:32.520
She'd have me and Fangsheng
rest for a while.

33:33.120 --> 33:34.200
Every night?

33:35.040 --> 33:36.120
Not every night.

33:36.200 --> 33:39.120
Before chanting, she'd have us
light the incense and candles.

33:39.200 --> 33:41.040
Once they burned down,

33:41.120 --> 33:42.920
she'd be finished.

33:43.000 --> 33:44.640
Right about an hour.

33:45.480 --> 33:46.760
An hour?

33:54.840 --> 33:56.280
That's not ordinary candles.

33:56.880 --> 33:58.280
They're ghee lamps meant to burn long.

33:58.880 --> 34:00.840
Your wound isn't healed. Rest today.

34:01.800 --> 34:02.880
Just a scratch.

34:02.960 --> 34:04.000
And with the old man's medicine,

34:04.080 --> 34:05.080
I'm fine.

34:07.560 --> 34:10.280
One ghee lamp burning out
takes far more than an hour.

34:27.080 --> 34:29.440
So her chanting
actually took over two hours.

34:29.520 --> 34:31.320
It didn't feel that long.

34:31.960 --> 34:33.159
When you steal a break,

34:33.239 --> 34:35.040
time seems to speed up.

34:35.560 --> 34:36.679
So Lady Wang

34:36.760 --> 34:38.840
probably used that two hours to slip out

34:38.920 --> 34:40.280
of Hanliang Hall alone.

34:41.600 --> 34:42.520
Then,

34:42.600 --> 34:43.880
we've got the time.

34:43.960 --> 34:45.679
Next we need the place and the person.

34:47.560 --> 34:49.239
With just two hours,

34:49.320 --> 34:50.639
if she was meeting someone,

34:51.679 --> 34:53.000
the round-trip walking time

34:53.080 --> 34:55.239
should be within an hour.

34:55.760 --> 34:58.280
Hanliang Hall sits
in the southeast corner.

34:58.360 --> 34:59.880
Let's search west and north.

35:00.400 --> 35:01.440
To the north is the garden.

35:01.520 --> 35:03.800
His Majesty's consorts
often go there for a stroll.

35:03.880 --> 35:04.720
So it's probably not there.

35:04.800 --> 35:06.320
Then let's search west.

35:09.960 --> 35:11.560
CHENG'EN PALACE

35:20.880 --> 35:22.960
Cheng'en Palace is under repair.

35:23.040 --> 35:25.800
But it's been over a year,
and it's still not finished.

35:25.880 --> 35:28.000
It's not Xingqing Palace's best location,

35:28.080 --> 35:29.400
but it's still an auspicious site.

35:29.920 --> 35:31.200
How could it be left this desolate?

35:31.880 --> 35:34.600
Cheng'en Palace being abandoned
is definitely suspicious.

35:35.200 --> 35:37.720
But isn't an abandoned and quiet palace

35:37.800 --> 35:39.280
perfect for a secret meeting?

36:12.280 --> 36:13.120
Mr. Xiao, look.

36:13.200 --> 36:14.400
In all of Cheng'en Palace,

36:14.480 --> 36:16.480
only this side room
is kept in perfect order.

36:16.560 --> 36:17.960
So it's not ordinary.

36:30.480 --> 36:32.120
This place was probably
cleared out recently.

36:32.840 --> 36:34.000
But something feels off.

36:35.000 --> 36:36.080
What feels off?

36:43.800 --> 36:45.320
Locking the door is useless.

36:45.400 --> 36:46.960
Trying to kill and silence
someone in the palace

36:47.040 --> 36:48.560
is pure delusion!

36:49.200 --> 36:51.200
Enjoy yourself, Your Ladyship.

36:55.800 --> 36:57.640
Mr. Xiao, what's wrong?

37:01.440 --> 37:02.600
Why is your forehead burning?

37:03.240 --> 37:04.400
Something's wrong with this room.

37:04.480 --> 37:05.440
What's wrong?

37:05.520 --> 37:06.360
The candles…

37:07.080 --> 37:08.200
Lust-inducing fumes!

37:27.360 --> 37:28.720
We underestimated them.

37:29.600 --> 37:31.520
Once my honor's on the line,

37:32.280 --> 37:34.280
no matter how capable I am,

37:34.360 --> 37:36.120
I will be severely constrained.

37:37.000 --> 37:38.600
You're not an ordinary woman.

37:39.640 --> 37:41.160
But if a woman's disgraced,

37:41.840 --> 37:43.880
it drags down more than just her.

37:55.280 --> 37:56.480
Tie me up,

37:56.560 --> 37:58.680
and they'll have no rumors to spread.

38:10.200 --> 38:11.280
Mr. Xiao.

38:13.440 --> 38:15.680
For once, you're both clever

38:15.760 --> 38:16.600
and simple.

38:37.120 --> 38:38.000
This room…

38:41.240 --> 38:42.080
is too dark.

39:32.320 --> 39:33.200
Your Ladyship?

39:34.200 --> 39:35.200
Your Ladyship?

39:35.880 --> 39:37.280
Your Ladyship?

39:51.240 --> 39:52.320
It's so hot.

39:56.960 --> 39:57.960
Should we…

39:58.840 --> 40:00.280
clear the air?

40:02.640 --> 40:03.480
The air between us?

40:17.800 --> 40:20.080
Your Ladyship, come help me.

40:20.160 --> 40:23.120
If we air it out,
it should ease the smoke.

40:30.840 --> 40:32.040
I inhaled it too.

40:33.040 --> 40:34.200
I'm out of strength.

40:43.640 --> 40:44.800
Your Ladyship,

40:45.480 --> 40:46.320
come here.

40:46.960 --> 40:48.800
Fresh air helps a lot.

40:50.840 --> 40:52.240
I'll help you over.

40:57.120 --> 40:58.120
Mr. Xiao,

40:59.000 --> 40:59.840
forgive me.

41:45.320 --> 41:47.800
Last night at Cheng'en Palace,

41:47.880 --> 41:49.000
we opened the door

41:49.080 --> 41:50.480
and the County Princess

41:50.560 --> 41:52.920
and Mr. Xiao on the bed, stark naked!

41:53.520 --> 41:56.000
Eunuch Liu was scared out of his wits!

41:57.560 --> 41:59.600
Fuchang County Princess
has always been willful,

41:59.680 --> 42:01.880
but to act like this before marriage

42:01.960 --> 42:03.280
is outrageously bold.

42:03.360 --> 42:06.520
I heard they say
she keeps a man by her side all day.

42:06.600 --> 42:07.640
I knew something was off.

42:07.720 --> 42:10.080
I never thought
she'd be this unrestrained.

42:10.600 --> 42:11.920
Yulan, right?

42:14.840 --> 42:16.120
I was looking for you.

42:20.120 --> 42:21.000
Looking for me?

42:21.520 --> 42:23.000
Someone asked me to pass you a message.

42:23.760 --> 42:25.200
The Imperial Guard at south side gate said

42:25.280 --> 42:27.200
he understands your feelings,

42:27.280 --> 42:29.000
but he's already betrothed.

42:29.080 --> 42:30.960
So he really can't accept your affection.

42:31.600 --> 42:33.760
He threw away
the handkerchief you gave him too.

42:33.840 --> 42:35.720
He says don't do this again.

42:35.800 --> 42:36.960
Feelings?

42:37.040 --> 42:37.920
A handkerchief?

42:38.000 --> 42:38.960
Hey…

42:39.040 --> 42:40.240
What are you talking about?

42:40.320 --> 42:41.960
What Imperial Guard? What handkerchief?

42:42.040 --> 42:42.960
Oh, besides,

42:43.040 --> 42:45.200
he also said from now on,

42:45.280 --> 42:47.800
don't sneak out
while you're on night duty.

42:47.880 --> 42:50.960
If someone sees you, it won't end well.

42:51.600 --> 42:54.120
Nonsense! Which idiot is spreading this?

42:55.280 --> 42:57.480
You're Yulan, new in Consort Shu's palace?

42:57.560 --> 42:59.040
With an orchid pattern
on your handkerchief?

42:59.720 --> 43:00.800
Yes.

43:01.760 --> 43:03.120
Then it's you, no doubt.

43:03.720 --> 43:05.120
Let me give you a warning.

43:05.200 --> 43:07.720
Keep a lower profile from now on.

43:07.800 --> 43:09.880
If this gets reported to Consort Shu,

43:09.960 --> 43:11.920
you'll be kicked out.

43:12.000 --> 43:12.840
What…

43:12.920 --> 43:14.000
- Let's leave.
- What are you even saying?

43:14.080 --> 43:16.400
I didn't do anything!
Why would I be kicked out?

43:18.040 --> 43:19.720
You like spreading rumors, don't you?

43:19.800 --> 43:21.360
Then you can be the lead this time.

43:21.960 --> 43:23.040
Hey…

43:28.000 --> 43:29.640
Boss. You're awake?

43:30.320 --> 43:31.240
Where's Mr. Xiao?

43:35.360 --> 43:36.760
At a time like this,

43:36.840 --> 43:38.360
you're still worried about Mr. Xiao?

43:41.320 --> 43:42.440
He was sent back to the Xiao's Mansion.

43:43.360 --> 43:44.360
Boss,

43:44.440 --> 43:46.400
no matter what, you're still a young lady.

43:46.480 --> 43:47.800
Next time you investigate at night,

43:47.880 --> 43:49.360
take me with you, okay?

43:49.440 --> 43:51.920
A man and a woman alone in a room,

43:52.000 --> 43:55.000
no matter what,
it sounds bad if it gets out.

43:56.120 --> 43:57.600
I was set up while working the case.

43:57.680 --> 44:00.120
Of course I know. But…

44:00.720 --> 44:02.240
others won't care about that.

44:02.320 --> 44:03.960
Royal secrets?

44:04.040 --> 44:06.640
The more thrilling
and wild it sounds, the better.

44:08.440 --> 44:09.880
Let's hear it. How wild?

44:12.040 --> 44:13.280
They…

44:13.880 --> 44:15.600
They said

44:15.680 --> 44:18.680
you used the case
as an excuse to meet Mr. Xiao,

44:18.760 --> 44:21.160
then lit "Love Incense"
and used too much of it.

44:22.280 --> 44:24.040
I can't stand those gossips.

44:26.600 --> 44:29.000
If I cared that much
about what people say,

44:29.080 --> 44:30.240
how could I live?

44:30.760 --> 44:32.200
As long as you believe me, I'm fine.

44:32.280 --> 44:34.480
Of course I believe you.

44:34.560 --> 44:36.840
Those gossiping have nothing better to do.

44:39.200 --> 44:40.280
How did they find me?

44:42.360 --> 44:43.720
A eunuch

44:43.800 --> 44:46.400
heard strange noises at Cheng'en Palace

44:46.480 --> 44:48.520
and saw ghost lights.
He insisted it was haunted.

44:48.600 --> 44:50.400
After the Hanliang Hall case,

44:50.480 --> 44:51.960
everyone in the palace was on edge.

44:52.040 --> 44:53.720
So that eunuch
led a squad of Imperial Guards

44:53.800 --> 44:56.360
to search Cheng'en Palace inside and out.

44:56.440 --> 44:59.480
Then, in the innermost room,

44:59.560 --> 45:01.200
they found you and Mr. Xiao.

45:01.840 --> 45:05.000
So the whole palace must've heard.

45:05.640 --> 45:06.480
Yes.

45:08.240 --> 45:09.080
Good.

45:10.440 --> 45:12.120
Good?

45:12.760 --> 45:14.240
Boss, you did it on purpose?

45:14.920 --> 45:15.840
Of course.

45:16.680 --> 45:17.720
Only if it made a big splash

45:17.800 --> 45:21.080
could they openly probe for news.
